"""
gate_c_q4.py — pre-registered q=4 orbit certificates and q=3,n=11
extension for cs/delcap.

Campaign:
  campaigns/2026-08-31T08:01:53Z_9108c7d1-73f8-40dc-8c4a-4db1c6d9dcbf_q4-orbit

The certificate mathematics is unchanged from frozen gate_c_orbit.py.  This
module replaces only the expensive all-input-word merged_OS constructor by the
exact orbit-stabilizer identity

  F_j(y_t) = sum_{x in O_j} A(x,y_t)
           = |O_j|/|T_t| * sum_{y in T_t} A(r_j,y),

and rebuilds the float-only BA locator with sparse orbit marginals.  All
verdicts remain one-shot exact-rational Arb certificates.  The floating locator
can affect width only.  See pre_statement.md for the fixed box and gates.
"""
